1
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:04,710
I'll let the president announce the results.

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:06,970
Good luck, everyone.

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,880
I'm really looking forward to it.

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,720
Yes!

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,970
Thank you.

6
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:17,480
The role of Feste the clown

7
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,730
goes to Saito Rin.

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,450
As for Duke Orsino,

9
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,570
I will play him.

10
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:37,450
Lady Olivia

11
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:42,670
will be played by Miyashita Kaede.

12
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,710
Huh?

13
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:50,550
And the lead role of Viola

14
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:54,800
goes to Yamamoto Minato.

15
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,390
M-Me?!

16
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:59,140
Minato is the lead?

17
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,440
But he's only a first-year.

18
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:02,400
Isn't Viola a girl?

19
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:05,020
Shouldn't Kaede-san be the lead?

20
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,570
What do you mean?

21
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:10,360
Viola is a girl, right?

22
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,910
It's a comedy about a girl dressing as a boy!

23
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:15,160
Exactly.

24
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,200
Having Minato cross-dress

25
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,540
to play Viola

26
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:18,870
will work best.

27
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:20,960
Minato cross-dressing

28
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,120
to play Viola?

29
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,210
Wait, what?

30
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:24,500
This will be

31
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,380
our little secret.

32
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:31,550
You've got to be kidding me...
